[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502530271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3502530271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3502530271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxF7f","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:20:32Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:20:32Z","body":"When PCK is loaded using this code? Usually it is loaded as `res://assets.sparsepck` and handled by `AAssetManager`/`FileAccessAndroid`. And `assets://` seems to be only used for Android Editor keystores.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502530271/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502579440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3502579440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3502579440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxR7w","user":{"login":"Benjamin-Dobell","id":482276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MjI3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/482276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell","html_url":"https://github.com/Benjamin-Dobell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:29:38Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:29:38Z","body":"Yeah, I'm honestly not too sure how often people typically try load `.pck` from `assets://`. I guess this will impact any file loaded from `assets://`, so if users are doing that for some reason and attempt to seek, that'll fail too. Again, presumably not that common or else this would have been raised before.\r\n\r\nAs to why I ran into this myself. I was setting up native Android debugging for [GodotJS](https://github.com/godotjs/GodotJS). I'm using `--main-pack` as quick and easy way to test my Godot projects.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502579440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502583312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3502583312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3502583312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxS4Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:30:28Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:30:28Z","body":"I think it'd be good to have a bug report to discuss the specific conditions and use case where this would happen","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502583312/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502602588","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3502602588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3502602588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QxXlc","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T13:34:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T13:34:21Z","body":"The change looks good. Probably was not noticed since keystore is always read/written in one chunk. It's not really related to PCK, since anything using `seek` should fail.\r\n\r\nBut I'm not sure what was the purpose of adding `assets://` in the first place, and whether it is supposed to be user accessible.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3502602588/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503948964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3503948964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3503948964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q2gSk","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T17:53:41Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T17:53:41Z","body":"> But I'm not sure what was the purpose of adding `assets://` in the first place, and whether it is supposed to be user accessible.\r\n\r\nThe `assets://` path provides a mean for editor build to access their own `assets` directory, since for editor builds, `res://` points to the general filesystem where the loaded project is stored.\r\nOn template builds, `res://` and `assets://` point to the same location, but are handled by different logic, so on template builds, using `res://` is the recommended approach.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3503948964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512073943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112507#issuecomment-3512073943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112507","id":3512073943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RVf7X","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-10T14:36:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-10T14:36:12Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3512073943/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]